# Specify files that shouldn't be modified by Fern

# src/main/java/com/whop/api/helpers/oidc is the hand-written OIDC helper. OidcToken trades a
# cloud provider's identity token for a short-lived Whop access token and renews it, and
# WhopOidc returns the generated client builders with their setAuthentication hook overridden
# to send it. It uses OkHttp and Jackson, which the SDK already depends on, and no generated
# code beyond that documented hook. Its tests live beside it so a regeneration cannot prune them.
src/main/java/com/whop/api/helpers/
src/test/java/com/whop/api/helpers/
